OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA blustery day with frequent
OL,6,Fshowers moving through with the strong
OL,7,Fsouthwesterly winds, winds touching
OL,8,Fgales in the afternoon. Some of the
OL,9,Fshowers may be heavy with a rumble of
OL,10,Fthunder or some hail.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining blustery with
OL,13,Fshowers continuing into the evening,
OL,14,Fwinds strengthening to gales at times
OL,15,Fand backing northwesterly so feeling
OL,16,Fquite cool later.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,19,Fthe day and showers finally becoming
OL,20,Fless frequent with some afternoon
OL,21,Fbrightness likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
