OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FAn
OL,6,Farea of rain spreading in on Monday
OL,7,Fhowever perhaps more settled towards
OL,8,Fthe middle of the week and feeling
OL,9,Fwarmer but still some showers at times.
